      "locked": false,
      "text": "Message\n- chatId (PK)\n- seq[timestamp + id] (SK)\n- id\n- timestamp\n- senderId\n- content\n- attachmentLink\n...\n\nInbox\n- clientId (PK)\n- seq[timestamp] (SK)\n- chatId\n- msgId\n...\n\n// or (avoid querying message again when fanout)\nInbox (store all the msg info)\n- clientId (PK)\n- seq[timestamp] (SK)\n- chatId, senderId, content, attachmentIds, ts\n...\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
